---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us & Our Guides | Saumya Tours Sri Lanka">
  <div class="bg-[#022c22] text-white py-16 border-b border-emerald-900 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-amber-300 font-mono">// 15+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-white">About Saumya Tours</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-emerald-100 text-sm font-light">
        Sri Lanka's trusted tour guide operator and pioneer in guided Buddhist Dambadiva pilgrimages from Sri Lanka.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
      <img src="/images/dambadiva.jpg" alt="Dambadiva Pilgrims with Saumya Tours" class="rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-emerald-800" />
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700">Our Spiritual & Travel Mission</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Guided with Compassion, Faith & Professionalism</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Saumya Tours was founded with a singular noble vision: to enable every Sri Lankan Buddhist devotee to experience the sacred Indian Dambadiva pilgrimage with complete comfort, authentic Sri Lankan full-board hospitality, and guidance from venerated Sinhala Buddhist monks.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Simultaneously, we welcome international and domestic travelers to explore Sri Lanka’s UNESCO world heritage treasures — Sigiriya, Kandy, Anuradhapura, Galle, and pristine national parks — guided by certified English/Sinhala chauffeur guides.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-xs space-y-2">
        <div class="text-3xl">☸️</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-emerald-950">Sinhala Monk Spiritual Leadership</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Every Dambadiva journey is accompanied by a respected senior Buddhist monk providing deep Dhamma commentary.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-xs space-y-2">
        <div class="text-3xl">🇱🇰</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-emerald-950">Official SLTDA Accreditation</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Fully registered and insured with the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority (Licence: SLTDA/SQA/TA/2026/089).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-xs space-y-2">
        <div class="text-3xl">🍲</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-emerald-950">Authentic Sri Lankan Full Board</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Our dedicated tour chefs travel with the group in India to prepare wholesome, warm Sri Lankan rice & curry meals 3 times a day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
